'''Zoge''' (ゾンビワン, ''Zonbiwan'') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Doge]] that appears in [[Zombie Outbreaks]], [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].
