==Enemy==
Zoge is the basic Zombie enemy, and so he doesn't do anything noteworthy apart from reviving and burrowing. He's much slower than [[Doge Dark]] and [[Gabriel]], but his abilities can briefly put a halt to your front lines. Due to his strong Area Attacks, it may be riskier to stall groups of Zoges in front of the [[Cat Base]] than other basic peons.

==Strategy==
Zoge is generally more of a nuisance than an actual threat. If you really have a hard time with him in Zombie Outbreaks, a good strategy is to spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cats]] to attack the enemy base head-on and trigger the burrows of any Zoges and other Zombies that may be spawning from it. Otherwise, you can use Giraffe Cat to have him burrow early and then use strong attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] to take him out in a few hits, or stack [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cats]] while protecting them with [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]]. Obviously, Area [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] such as [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]], [[Li'l Bird Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Flying Cat]] and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] excel against Zoge, although only Polevaulter Cat is realistically obtainable before this enemy becomes irrelevant.

